  "title": "Nana Lara's Brisket",
  "description": "A flavorful but chewy cut like a brisket needs a long, slow trip through the oven to break down the connective tissue and release the beefy goodness. A spice rub and a bit of crushed pineapple add their spicy, sweet flavors to the meat.",
